  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_8830.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde de este martes en las fiestas del barrio San Joaqu&iacute;n de Onda ha estado dedicada a la entrada y suelta de vaquillas de la ganader&iacute;a El Mijares. Por la noche, tras la embolada infantil,&nbsp;han soltado&nbsp;vaquillas enfundadas y se ha embolado un toro en la calle Padre Ten.</p>\n<p><br />\n &nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vaquesdimartssantjoaquim14/img_8815.jpg\" alt=\"img_8815\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vaquesdimartssantjoaquim14/img_8816.jpg\" alt=\"img_8816\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vaquesdimartssantjoaquim14/img_8818.jpg\" alt=\"img_8818\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vaquesdimartssantjoaquim14/img_8820.jpg\" alt=\"img_8820\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vaquesdimartssantjoaquim14/img_8821.jpg\" alt=\"img_8821\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vaquesdimartssantjoaquim14/img_8822.jpg\" alt=\"img_8822\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vaquesdimartssantjoaquim14/img_8823.jpg\" alt=\"img_8823\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vaquesdimartssantjoaquim14/img_8825.jpg\" alt=\"img_8825\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vaquesdimartssantjoaquim14/img_8827.jpg\" alt=\"img_8827\" style=\"max-wid